{
  "name": "TestRunIsolatesMemoryStackBetweenTests",
  "comment": "Fresh-App-per-test guard. Runs two paired fixtures under test.run with\ntest's setting parallel=1: AIsolationPollute writes %shared_probe%=1; BIsolationProbe\nasserts %shared_probe% is null at entry. If the runner regressed to\nsharing MemoryStack, Probe would read the polluted value and fail.\nParallel=1 forces sequential execution so the ordering is deterministic.",
